# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows'
# included. Tests compare generated text with committed text (golden files,
# byte-for-byte samples, the source a lint reads), and the gate scripts run
# under Git Bash; a CRLF checkout (`core.autocrlf=true`, Git for Windows'
# default) failed them for the checkout and not for the code. Git decides
# what is text; binaries are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
